msgid "Saved Xteink address:\n\n%s\n\nDo you want to use this address?"
msgstr "Adresse Xteink enregistrée :\n\n%s\n\nVoulez-vous utiliser cette adresse ?"

msgid "No Xteink X3 is saved.\n\nDo you want to scan the network?"
